        70.86609649658203,
        94.06519317626953,
        440.2950744628906,
        107.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "In relation to resource requirements, the following questions are answered:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
