        78.81909942626953,
        126.96220397949219
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        113.81720733642578,
        410.876953125,
        126.96220397949219
      ],
      "text": "How large are the resource requirements for test implementation?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.31719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        142.4622039794922
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        129.31719970703125,
        415.2982482910156,
        142.4622039794922
      ],
      "text": "What is the certainty of the evidence about resource requirements?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.81719970703125,
        78.81909942626953,
        157.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        144.81719970703125,
        524.410400390625,
        157.9622039794922
      ],
      "text": "Does the cost–effectiveness of the intervention favour the intervention or the comparison?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.1634063720703,
        192.1369171142578,
        189.5434112548828
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.79443359375,
        388.9150085449219,
        212.93943786621094
      ],
      "text": "Available evidence on cost–effectiveness is evaluated and scored.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.30592346191406,
        112.7667007446289,
        241.68592834472656
      ],
      "text": "Equity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.9368896484375,
        526.765625,
        265.0819091796875
      ],
      "text": "GDG members consider whether implementing the tool or method will positively or negatively",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977827072143555,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        267.4368896484375,
        526.9633178710938,
        280.5819091796875
      ],
      "text": "affect access to health care (e.g. will it be possible to implement the test in distinct levels of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.9368896484375,
        527.0733032226562,
        296.0819091796875
      ],
      "text": "health care or through self-administration, or are there other ways to make the tools or method",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.959826469421387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        298.4368896484375,
        302.180908203125,
        311.5819091796875
      ],
      "text": "available to all levels of the health care system).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        323.94842529296875,
        156.2059326171875,
        340.3283996582031
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.57940673828125,
        526.965576171875,
        363.72442626953125
      ],
      "text": "In terms of acceptability, the panel considers whether the tool or method will be acceptable",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        366.07940673828125,
        475.0884704589844,
        379.22442626953125
      ],
      "text": "by all relevant stakeholders, such as health workers, health managers and patients.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.5910339355469,
        136.2740936279297,
        407.97100830078125
      ],
      "text": "Feasibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.221923828125,
        527.055908203125,
        431.366943359375
      ],
      "text": "The GDG considers how feasible it is to implement a tool or method in various settings. Aspects",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.975522994995117,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        433.721923828125,
        526.991943359375,
        446.866943359375
      ],
      "text": "such as training and refresher training needs, hands-on time, biosafety requirements, time to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        449.221923828125,
        526.9666137695312,
        462.366943359375
      ],
      "text": "results, service and maintenance, calibration, and effect on diagnostic algorithms are all taken",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.721923828125,
        218.26380920410156,
        477.866943359375
      ],
      "text": "into account in the final score.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.7259216308594,
        526.9615478515625,
        501.8709411621094
      ],
